      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Contraindicated with urinary retention, gastric retention or uncontrolled narrow-angle glaucoma. CNS effects including dizziness, somnolence, confusion and hallucinations still occur. Severe renal impairment requires dose reduction; moderate impairment can also increase anticholinergic adverse effects."),
