      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Observed high-grade prostate-cancer diagnoses were increased in prevention trials; dutasteride is not approved for prevention. Pregnant people must not handle leaking capsules because skin absorption can disrupt external genital development in a male fetus. Any confirmed PSA rise from the on-treatment nadir requires evaluation."),
