      keyLabs: ["Renal function", "Urinalysis and culture before or early in therapy", "CBC, methemoglobin, bilirubin and liver tests if cyanosis, hemolysis or toxicity is suspected"],
      nclexTraps: ["Orange urine is expected dye excretion, not hematuria or proof of cure.", "Phenazopyridine relieves symptoms but cannot replace an antibiotic or obstruction evaluation.", "The 2-day rule answers evidence and diagnostic-masking concerns as well as toxicity vigilance."],
