      sourceNote: "Curated from current U.S. phenazopyridine labeling and OTC monograph products: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=f40ea909-9df7-c90a-e053-2995a90a2987 and https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=b4874fe2-d98b-4b5c-baad-d75070947842",
